    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lifetime diagnostics for an Anderson acceleration workspace.</para>
<para>Counters accumulate from aa_init and are not cleared by aa_reset, including internal resets after safeguard rejections. Rejection causes are split so a caller can tell what needs tuning. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
